title: "On the Kelly monoidal structure of $$\\Lambda$$-sequences and unital operads"
collection: publications
category: manuscripts
permalink: https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.12738
excerpt: 'We study properties of monoids and modules in $$\Lambda$$-sequences under the Kelly monoidal structure. In particular, we show that the forgetful functor from right modules in $$\Lambda$$-sequences to right modules in symmetric sequences is an isomorphism. We show that any compatible lower data extends to a normal oplax monoidal structure and use this to establish a universal normal oplax monoidal structure on $$\Lambda$$-sequences extending the Kelly product, identifying unital operads to monoids in unital $$\Lambda$$-sequences for a general symmetric monoidal category. We also establish a closed monoidal localization theorem.'
